<h2 id="includes">What This Service Includes</h2>
<p>Strategic consulting is for the decisions above the day-to-day — the ones about direction, structure, and growth. We work alongside ownership and leadership to think through where the practice is headed and how to get there without overextending.</p>

<h3>Where We Help</h3>
<div class="dash-list">
  <div class="dash-list-item">Executive leadership and advisory support for practice owners</div>
  <div class="dash-list-item">Practice transformation — rethinking how the practice operates</div>
  <div class="dash-list-item">Expansion planning for new services or new locations</div>
  <div class="dash-list-item">Decision support grounded in operational reality, not just strategy on paper</div>
</div>

<h2 id="transformation">Practice Transformation</h2>
<p>Adding a regenerative service line often surfaces bigger questions about how the whole practice runs. We help you work through those — staffing, structure, operations, and standards — so a change in one area strengthens the practice rather than straining it.</p>

<h2 id="expansion">Expansion Planning</h2>
<p>Expansion is where good practices most often overreach. We help you plan growth deliberately — evaluating readiness, sequencing, and the operational groundwork each step requires — so expansion builds on a stable base instead of stretching a thin one.</p>

<div class="callout">
  <div class="callout-label">Grounded in operations</div>
  <p class="callout-body">Because Regenitiva also builds and runs the operational side of regenerative programs, our strategic guidance is grounded in what actually happens on the floor — not advice handed down without a way to execute it.</p>
</div>

<div class="numbered-steps">
