      <div class="numbered-step-title">Plan</div>
      <p class="numbered-step-body">We develop a direction and a realistic path — transformation, expansion, or both.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="numbered-step">
    <span class="numbered-step-badge">3</span>
    <div>
      <div class="numbered-step-title">Execute</div>
      <p class="numbered-step-body">We can help put the plan into motion, drawing on Regenitiva's operational services as needed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 id="start">Getting Started</h2>
<p>The first step is an introductory conversation — a short call with our CEO, Vince Surra, to talk through whether a practice assessment makes sense for you.</p>
<p>Reach out through the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> and we'll be in touch within 48 hours, or book a call directly.</p>

